        "Identify with your callsign at least every 10 minutes during a contact and at the end. No encryption, no business traffic, no music." to "Identifícate con tu indicativo al menos cada 10 minutos durante un contacto y al final. Sin cifrado, sin tráfico comercial, sin música.",
        "If your radio isn't listed: tries any serial service it offers; the monitor lists what it found." to "Si tu radio no aparece: se prueba cualquier servicio serie que ofrezca; el monitor muestra lo que encontró.",
